Setear gcloud client to access service 

gcloud auth application-default login 


Habilitar Artifact Repository 
Crear un Repository para el proyecto en una zona determinada (us-central1)


Ejecutar el siguiente conjunto de comando para instalar docker-credential-gcr
VERSION=2.1.22
OS=linux  # or "darwin" for OSX, "windows" for Windows.
ARCH=amd64  # or "386" for 32-bit OSs

curl -fsSL "https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/docker-credential-gcr/releases/download/v${VERSION}/docker-credential-gcr_${OS}_${ARCH}-${VERSION}.tar.gz" \
| tar xz docker-credential-gcr \
&& chmod +x docker-credential-gcr && sudo mv docker-credential-gcr /usr/bin/


docker-credential-gcr configure-docker --registries=us-central1-docker.pkg.dev

echo "https://us-central1-docker.pkg.dev" | docker-credential-gcr get


gcloud auth configure-docker us-central1-docker.pkg.dev

us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/careful-acumen-422922-k4/hiluca-docker-repository/strapi:latest

docker tag strapi us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/careful-acumen-422922-k4/hiluca-docker-repository/strapi:latest
docker push us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/careful-acumen-422922-k4/hiluca-docker-repository/strapi:latest

